Error [jet.UsePrivateModuleItem]: `SqliteDB` is private in module `core.db`
  --> tests/ui/core_db_handle_qualified_is_private.jet:6:8
    |
  6 |     d: db.SqliteDB{raw: 1}
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A Core module's API is the names it exports; its other types and helpers belong to Core alone
 Fix: Use what `core.db` exports instead
